{"id":"chest_","lemma":"честь","pos":"noun","rank":329,"glosses":["honor","regard, respect"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/25/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"чести"},"examples":[{"text":"С кем имею честь?","en":"With whom do I have the honor of speaking?","words":[{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"who","l":"кто"},{"g":"to have, to possess","l":"иметь"},null]},{"text":"Для меня большая честь быть здесь.","en":"I'm honored to be here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661099","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Я думал, что ты человек чести.","en":"I thought you were a man of honor.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"person"},null]},{"text":"Встретиться с вами — большая честь.","en":"It's a great honor to be able to meet you.","words":[{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Это дело чести.","en":"It's a matter of pride.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"affair"},null]}]}